'''Yakisoba U.F.O. Cat''' (ネコ焼そばU.F.O., ''Neko Yakisoba U.F.O.'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Nissin U.F.O. Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Yakisoba U.F.O. Cat
|image = E 508.png
|appearance = [[Nissin U.F.O. Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 200円 - 790円
}}

==Enemy==
A [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] peon with melee range and chance to slow cats. It doesn't have much health and deals low damage, but can become dangerous near the final stages of [[U.F.O. Corps Strikes!]].

==Strategy==
Outside of U.F.O. Corps Strikes!, it has very low magnifications, and shouldn't be worried about, as most things will be able to kill it and survive its attacks. In said [[Gauntlet]], it can go up to '''600,000 health''' and '''30,000 damage''', requiring specific anti-[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]] Cats to deal with it, with [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] being great non-Uber options for dishing out damage. [[Windy (Uber Rare Cat)|Windy]], along with any other anti-Floating [[:Category:Nuker-class Cats|Nukers]], will all work well, as they can take off large chunks of their health, if not outright killing them.

